 kit issues - lists the repository's open issues, and the forge's milestones and iterations

   one of
   *kit issues*  lists the repository's open issues, and the forge's milestones and iterations

     --text   --json   --jq
                           prints the stages as text, even on a terminal

   --stages    prints the stages, one per line, in order, the same over any workspace
   --marks     prints a mark per stage, as one JSON object, which changes when what the stage draws
               does; null for a stage with none, as iterations
   milestones  each milestone of the repository, open and closed, by number
   iterations  each iteration, by start
   issues      every open issue, in the backlog or underway, as kit flow issues prints it; on a
               terminal it opens in kittui
   backlog     the open issues in the backlog, the issues tab's Backlog preset; on a terminal it
               opens in kittui on that preset
   underway    the open issues underway, the issues tab's Underway preset; on a terminal it opens in
               kittui on that preset


 kit issues
